			"id": "agent-analysis-mine-har-module-mvvm-tab-slice",
			"interpretation": "HAR module 'mine' (module.json5 type har) encapsulating the Mine tab as an MVVM slice. Public surface: Index.ets, the oh-package.json5 main of @ohos/mine, exports MineHomeView, MineEventType, MinePageVM, MinePageState; oh-package.json5 pins file: deps on @ohos/common and @ohos/commonbusiness (BaseHomeViewModel, HmosRequest, PreferenceCacheHelper, Toast) plus kits (BasicServicesKit, UIDesignKit HDS, ArkUI). Relations: router_map.json registers five routes (MineView, MineSettingsView, NewContentView, AboutView, BulletinView) with @Builder functions in view/. Behavior: MinePageVM is a singleton event pump; sendEvent dispatches MineEventType cases (login/logout, INIT_DATA reload, jumps to new-content/bulletin) and listGroupData wires item taps to them. MineService fetches NewContentData via HmosRequest, annotating sample-card requests with deviceInfo deviceType/sdkApiVersion, and caches into preferences; BulletinModel retries from the preference cache when its network call rejects. Strings localize via base/en_US/zh_CN resources. Contract: exported names, route name/buildFunction pairs, the event enum, and common-module call signatures must stay compatible.",
